                                                "sense_id": "6c3b5999-2b47-367e-bf49-2a106a5b4f4f",
                                                "text": "Injuries and conditions that cause an acid pH environment cause the globin (protein) molecule to separate from the ferrihemate (iron-containing) component of the myoglobin molecule."
                                            },
