                                                "sense_id": "6c3b5999-2b47-367e-bf49-2a106a5b4f4f",
                                                "text": "Globin switches in yolk sac–like primitive and fetal-like definitive red blood cells produced from human embryonic stem cells [title of article]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18a93c03-f33c-4bae-8a33-fc1e4c196f2a",
                                                "sense_id": "6c3b5999-2b47-367e-bf49-2a106a5b4f4f",
                                                "text": "The results showed that the globin expression in the erythroid cells in individual clones changed in a time-dependent manner."
                                            }
